{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20160",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.86,
      "end_seconds": 6.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Afternoon, doctor. They're in and comfortable, and I have the measurements ready."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.06,
      "end_seconds": 12.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Thanks, that's helpful. Hello, please sit. What's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.24,
      "end_seconds": 21.06,
      "duration_seconds": 7.82,
      "text": "Honestly, it's pain in my lower back, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.58,
      "end_seconds": 24.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "how long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.5,
      "end_seconds": 37.61,
      "duration_seconds": 11.11,
      "text": "honestly I can't say exactly when it started. It might have been last month or the month before, I really can't pin it down"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.06,
      "end_seconds": 45.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.93,
      "end_seconds": 61.95,
      "duration_seconds": 15.02,
      "text": "I'd say a few times a day. I'd give it a eight, out of ten. I notice it more with lifting. I get some relief from lying flat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.45,
      "end_seconds": 68.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.82,
      "end_seconds": 85.75,
      "duration_seconds": 15.93,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a stooped back as well. Hmm, the stooped back? That's been for two months. I've also been losing height, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.48,
      "end_seconds": 94.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "A few quick ones: weight loss, fever, numbness in the legs or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.69,
      "end_seconds": 98.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.42,
      "end_seconds": 102.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.9,
      "end_seconds": 108.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Let me think, that's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.87,
      "end_seconds": 114.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.93,
      "end_seconds": 119.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "ah, bowels are regular, nothing odd"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.03,
      "end_seconds": 125.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.72,
      "end_seconds": 138.06,
      "duration_seconds": 10.34,
      "text": "I had a reaction to amoxicillin when I was younger, a rash all over, and I've avoided it since."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.26,
      "end_seconds": 140.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.83,
      "end_seconds": 145.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.64,
      "end_seconds": 148.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.14,
      "end_seconds": 150.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.58,
      "end_seconds": 154.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.57,
      "end_seconds": 159.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.75,
      "end_seconds": 163.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.71,
      "end_seconds": 167.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.27,
      "end_seconds": 174.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.04,
      "end_seconds": 178.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.91,
      "end_seconds": 186.27,
      "duration_seconds": 6.36,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.88,
      "end_seconds": 191.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "I take alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.04,
      "end_seconds": 210.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.83,
      "end_seconds": 215.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Thin bones, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.72,
      "end_seconds": 221.67,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Right, right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.1,
      "end_seconds": 226.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "An underactive thyroid, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.53,
      "end_seconds": 233.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "Right, yes, thin bones is known to us, good to have that clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 244.71,
      "end_seconds": 252.49,
      "duration_seconds": 7.78,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Height 185 centimetres, pulse 83, BP is 123 over 75, weight 65 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.03,
      "end_seconds": 253.73,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.05,
      "end_seconds": 258.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.8,
      "end_seconds": 261.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.18,
      "end_seconds": 283.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.81,
      "text": "There is tenderness over the mid lower spine and no weakness in the legs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.62,
      "end_seconds": 289.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.9,
      "end_seconds": 326.8,
      "duration_seconds": 27.9,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, this is probably thin bones with a fragility fracture and back pain. A spinal compression fracture is also on my list. Let's book a spine X-ray to look into back pain. If you have new weakness or numbness in your legs, that's the point to come in urgently. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.79,
      "end_seconds": 331.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.81,
      "end_seconds": 334.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}